This repository publishes an unofficial npm bridge for Nastech Agent. npm
release synchronization follows the latest official non-draft,
non-prerelease GitHub Release from the upstream project.

Nastech Agent is developed by Nastech Research.
Upstream repository: https://github.com/NastechResearch/nastech-agent
Upstream releases: https://github.com/NastechResearch/nastech-agent/releases
Upstream license: MIT
Upstream copyright notice: Copyright (c) 2025 Nastech Research

This repository does not claim ownership of upstream source code, the Nastech
Agent name, or Nastech Research marks. It provides Node.js command shims,
installation orchestration, release metadata, and an npm-specific update/status
interface.

The published npm tarball contains bridge code, not the upstream source tree.
During installation, Git fetches the exact upstream Release tag and verifies
that it resolves to the full commit SHA recorded in package.json. The installed
checkout remains mutable because `nastech update` intentionally invokes the
native upstream rolling updater.

